        <!-- Legend / notes -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Notes verified against the running system&#10;&#10;• api.js declares tasks + purchase-order methods with no server routes — /api/tasks and /api/purchase-orders return 404&#10;• views/Backlog.vue is fully implemented but unrouted and unreachable&#10;• Reports.vue imports axios directly, bypassing api.js, and ignores the global filter bar&#10;• purchase_orders.json is empty, so has_purchase_order is always false&#10;• Filtering is server-side; totals and charts are client-side computed properties over hand-built SVG" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEFCE8;strokeColor=#CA8A04;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
